Package: manned-pages
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0, libc6
Maintainer: Patrick Karuri <pkariithi@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: A modern, user-friendly Linux command reference application
 Manned Pages is an intuitive desktop application that provides comprehensive
 documentation for the most commonly used Linux commands. Designed specifically
 for Ubuntu with the native Yaru theme, it presents command information in a
 clean, accessible interface that's easier to navigate than traditional man pages.
 .
Features:
  - Comprehensive command database with 50+ Linux commands
  - Two-pane interface for easy navigation
  - Smart search across command fields
  - Light and dark theme support
  - JSON view with syntax highlighting
  - Installation instructions for installable commands
  - Real-world examples with output explanations

